From ce7b19de847d5225c913e965c04378527f6a2259 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 05:09:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: implement Abyss Salvage MVP from the master plan

Builds the code side of ABYSS_SALVAGE_MASTER_PLAN.md as a Rojo/Luau project:

- Shared: configs for zones, 60 relics, rarities, mutations, upgrades, suits,
  passes, products, events, quests and economy; server-authoritative LootRoll,
  Formulas, Net remotes, WeightedRandom, NumberFormat, RateLimiter, Signal.
- Server (24 services): session-locked DataStore profiles, currencies, boosts,
  monetization with idempotent ProcessReceipt / bundles / Pass+ / Premium /
  Starter Pack / policy-gated crates, runtime graybox world, docks with idle and
  offline income, loot nodes with sonar pre-rolls and pity, diving (oxygen,
  pressure, escape, revive, bag drops), Leviathan AI and hazards, raids with
  all guardrails, trading, parties, quests, Tide Pass, rebirth and talents,
  leaderboards, announcements, codes, admin/LiveConfig, anti-exploit checks.
- Client: custom swim controller, depth lighting, HUD, shop, bag/dock manager,
  upgrades, codex, quests, rebirth, leaderboards, trade, settings, reveal
  cards, contextual offers, FTUE objectives.
- Tooling: aftman/selene/stylua configs, CI, Lune unit tests, economy sim,
  docs/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md mapping every plan section to code.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FawWwHcBFKCRxor4f1DW9u
